WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.250
It's so strange

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.090
Is the spirit of speech true?

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:05.650
The guy who's lying

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.650
Fell into the sky

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.180
I heard so, but

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:10.800
Seems though he is

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.810
loved by everyone

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:16.100
The feelings I want to feel

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.890
Therefore, it is free

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.440
Turned from a mysterious wizardry

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.390
Utopia

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.020
You're here.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.690
Today too, with just that

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:28.030
I am reminded of the pain of living

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:31.400
The difference between I love you and I'm sorry

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.950
It's like the moon and the sun

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:38.330
It's ok, I'll see you again tomorrow

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:41.790
Even the soul that never learns anything

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:44.080
I think of you again

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.330
This life too

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:47.500
Turn the page to the next chapter

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.050
A song that you turned into stone

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:54.800
I'll walk while humming

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:57.760
I'll laugh knowing I'm not alone

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:01.340
Thick next book

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:05.890
A song that I got sick

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.640
I'll walk while humming

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.650
I'll walk my lonesome night

00:01:12.310 --> 00:01:13.520
I love you

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:14.520
I'm sorry

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:15.820
See you then

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:19.110
It's like the sun at night

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.820
Kusushiki flow of time

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:26.080
A soul that has found something important

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:28.450
I think of you again

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:30.480
Next life too
